crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f91d3abde9c9bf06c2b83581a5f8e52 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. My name is Tokino, and I am a private VTuber.\nI am fascinated by the wonderful design, the use of light, and the use of blue,\nI would like to send you a request. I hope you will consider my request.\n\nContents\nCharacteristics: Slightly pinched red eyes. Hair: Short, dark light blue + white mesh hair (with honeycomb on the right side), elf, black rimmed glasses. Butterfly and wizard motif.\n\nClothing: I will leave it up to you.\n\n　For reference, please refer to the following URL for the outfit I usually wear.\n　https://twitter.com/tkino_nono/status/1665739445822431232\n　If you use this URL, please feel free to simplify or omit the detailed decorations.\n\nPreferred situation:\n　Since her birthday is coming up, we would like Tokino to look happy amidst the festive confetti.\n\nIntended use\nFor personal viewing\nWe would like to use the image for posting on social networking sites (with the artist's name) and as a thumbnail for distribution.\nWe would appreciate it if you could give us the background and the person separately.\n\nThank you very much for your understanding.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/tkino_nono/status/1665739445822431232", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f765442e/uploads/origins/5ba61f2e-c3bd-4ae3-a12f-8230412f0f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e09c7501d129fbcfbeb7864f7e36524a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f765442e/uploads/origins/5ba61f2e-c3bd-4ae3-a12f-8230412f0f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=