0&s=f21cc71a75eb684244dfcd05302717f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc4b7af8/uploads/origins/8f6f7ce7-ac14-407f-8d07-c0abfe7712ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f21cc71a75eb684244dfcd05302717f9, https://si.imgix.net/bc4b7af8/uploads/origins/8f6f7ce7-ac14-407f-8d07-c0abfe7712ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=180fef3814a7554663daac2e35ba9ce3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bc4b7af8/uploads/origins/8f6f7ce7-ac14-407f-8d07-c0abfe7712ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa59f708d7eb18fd23cc9289b6aa36f2 3x"}, "body": "Hello, your artwork is very pretty!\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my Vtuber character. She is a cosmic mage with a carefree attitude and a bubbly personality. I'd like her to be holding an open umbrella in a rainy scene. For the umbrella, I'd like for it to have a galaxy pattern on the inside, similar to the reference below.  I will leave the expression and background up to you. You may pick either outfit from the links below, and please take note of the ring on the left hand. I would like to be able to use the artwork on SNS. I would also be grateful if the character and background were separated.\n\nOutfit 1: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gFqRIxIytpOVndXdEBxydOgUib3LC8lx/view?usp=sharing\n\nOutfit 2: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1957nKQVQxjoGVRatpiBcAuopeA405lyL?usp=sharing\n\nInside of umbrella: https://twitter.com/tmiuraGA/status/1622618209617862658\n\nThank you for your consideration!!!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1944458, "client_id": 1288717, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70d73adf20a31fa9ee0a4bce47fc33b8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70d73adf20a31fa9ee0a4bce47fc33b8, https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=183a42f3a43e72b7e2bd0c0e96f361d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b39a6c717a2de80c4bd230b2b726c26 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d9dac93538600691b375ab74253f0b5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d9dac93538600691b375ab74253f0b5, https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=92cda8912d1301d803e8c84d8ad8bf08 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb0b1f19/uploads/origins/d2a91aa8-e67f-4aa7-a4e6-0cf438bbcd83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dedfdb9ec13fade01b5f39551d38252e 3x"}, "body": "Hoshien Mukumu-sama\n\nIt is nice to meet you.\nMy name is Yohkou Violet and I am currently active as a Vtuber.\nI saw a very nice illustration on Twitter.\nI would like to request an illustration of myself.\nI would appreciate it if you could check the standing picture etc. below.\n\nYohkoh Violet (@yako_sumire)\nhttps://twitter.com/yako_sumire/status/1565132021340721152\n\nContents\nAtmosphere: Fearless smile, mysterious atmosphere.\nComposition: Full body from the waist up. Pose and other details are left up to the artist.\nClothing: Any style you wish.\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the background and the person.\nI would like to use the image as a social networking icon or a thumbnail for a video streaming service.\n\nWe would like to use them as social networking icons and thumbnails.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/yako_sumire/status/1565132021340721152", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1944458, "client_id": 1716582, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4425bdb8ee57427756d1f5cdccc28f60", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4425bdb8ee57427756d1f5cdccc28f60, https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d84053e8cf0ca48242b40d6d394e2c6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c10a63840ff270ec078868eaeefde6c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a95525299ee517e238b89ca540a39c42", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a95525299ee517e238b89ca540a39c42, https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2eed14d8225573884fdded4fe1a9960e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d63c990/uploads/origins/21b066c9-8a80-4c1d-8f8a-3c7a8b4ca6eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=910bda888cd178a27226a212d406dad1 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your help, I am Ruka Sorasaki, a Vtuber.\nI would very much like to have Mr. Hoshien Muku draw my illustration.\n\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration of me on my knees, and I will leave the composition, etc. to you.\nI would be happy if you could draw a cheerful and cute illustration of me.\nI would also like to have a transparent image.\nShe has a hairline on the right side, and her hair is a gradation of light blue and purple.\nA slight difference in color is not a problem.\nYou can change the clothes and hair style.\nI leave it up to Hoshien Muku-sama.\nFor other reference images, please see my Twitter fan art tag in the document URL.\n\nWe will use the illustrations you provide as thumbnails for our distribution and in our activities.\nPlease note that there is a possibility that we may give the illustrations to activists or companies when we conduct activities.\nWe will use them in our monetized distribution, but will not use them for commercial purposes such as merchandise.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/sorasaki_ruka", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1944458, "client_id": 2539400, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=102a56b65b19d6f720614a124ca29b64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=102a56b65b19d6f720614a124ca29b64, https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a84bf9e81de4afec7d10717a2cd78b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df570e8d2abcee1818153121e2bc252a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f99d5af4271ff0c8e4d87bb965663357", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f99d5af4271ff0c8e4d87bb965663357, https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b715e179657408420bdae6e4cae88ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92b55ec2/uploads/origins/7e201e22-8beb-4f54-92ca-01ea725f9a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=89e40d5363d5dcd645e0c0c9b2bcf651 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI saw a tweet from someone who doesn't have FF and thought you were a wonderful illustrator! I thought that you are a wonderful illustrator and I would like to make a request.\n\nI would like you to draw an illustration for ⬛︎.\nUsage→Twitter icon, distribution thumbnail\n\n⬛︎ Details\nCharacteristics→Affine hair like an angel's ring, white highlights of cat eyes, fangs on upper and lower jaw, can also be a cat.\nColor: white and light purple\nHairstyle→Short wolf, white hair (with light purple highlights and shadows)\nClothing: I will leave it to you.\nAccessories and accessories: 🐈 and 🌙 fan symbols for reference only.\nWe will leave it up to you. There is no particular requirement to wear cat ears, etc.\n\nWe will be happy if you can make the illustration transparent when you use it as a thumbnail.\n\nPlease refer to ⬛︎\nClick here for illustrations of faces, expressions, and other people's illustrations.\n\nTwitter\n@sukigaki_yoru_\n\nFA tag\n#translucent drawing\n\nSorry if it was hard to understand.\nThank you for your cooperation!\n\nhttps://youtube.com/@Sukigakiyoru", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1944458, "client_id": 1267538, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31e9698a9e0932315487ac3cba1e0100", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31e9698a9e0932315487ac3cba1e0100, https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cd588f85c1d0e5cb51629d263346510 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bc19d27b4a8ef7f082543ba3f334664 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=184082f55fa4cdb4030b3289db8fb028", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=184082f55fa4cdb4030b3289db8fb028, https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9081644a83607368fe8be651ebe01ffb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d73aa3b/uploads/origins/440cad8a-c63d-4887-97c9-494b5d47fa82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a12697a6d9496e2ee3945ef1972d92ad 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Articulated Dusk Daku, a private Vtuber.\nI have been looking at your illustrations for a long time, and I especially like your drawings and the expressions on your characters' faces, so I sent a request.\nWhat I would like you to draw for me this time is an illustration of \"Kudak, the gruff Kudak\".\n\nRequests\nI would like him to wear earrings! I would be happy if the location is up to the ears, or even other places, up to the tongue.\nIf possible, I would like the clothes to be something that looks badass, whether it be a scajan or something simple, as long as it is badass!\nIf possible, we would like the clothes to be of the same color as the original!\nI would be happy if the color of the clothes could be similar to the original clothes!\n\n We would be happy if you could arrange the hair in any way you like, as long as it doesn't ruin the base.\nAnyway, we would like to see a nice, bad-looking, dusky bite.\n\n Material and three views] https://twitter.com/Kamikura_Kudaku/status/1478684091017207812?t=x8wT-f_Sp6a22tkK1W5rCg&s=19\n\n[Usage.\nWe are planning to use the character for personal viewing, SNS icons, YouTube video and distribution thumbnails, announcement images, and other Vtuber activities.\n We would appreciate it if you could give us a transparency layer of the character as we would like to use it for thumbnails, etc.\n\n[Background\nWe would be happy to have a simple one, but since it will mainly be used for thumbnails and Vtuber activities, it is fine if you have one or not.\n\n[twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/Kamikura_Kudaku?t=0BlHpx7Ku7_VqhdWS6-_Jw&s=09\n\nIf it is too demanding, please cancel.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate your consideration.\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Kamikura_Kudaku/status/1478684091017207812?t=x8wT-f_Sp6a22tkK1W5rCg&s=19", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shion_Muku/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1944458, "client_id": 1979256, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ce231ab/uploads/origins/5e19bff4-ca69-4894-87de-67df04f9de3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=051a5b7bd7b3809636f26caff6f3167b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ce231ab/uploads/origins/5e19bff4-ca69-4894-87de-67df04f9de3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=051a5b7bd7b3809636f26caff6f3167b, https://si.imgix.net/3ce231ab/uploads/origins/5e19bff4-ca69-4894-87de-67df04f9de3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=645bb300810cdd54b09cd24c8736f830 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ce231ab/uploads/origins/5e19bff4-ca69-4894-87de-67df04f9de3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6940832b87cb7a492ad376287c62192 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ce231ab/uploads/origins/5e19bff4-ca69-4894-87de-67df04f9de3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres